 "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036703_576173451444056_2815308939854354726_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TIG1npdsvP4Q7kNvwEpNubd&_nc_oc=AdoZBQili7s6qIhKp44DdC1nBizaebHPhb7Kbffiffl1MdEKpsHADHO_mwA_B0fPGqM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTAMQMCnBrb-r7erM97c9re0vPOPaUKwGnvL0lJNTrzjw&oe=6AF8A5A8"}, {"file_name": "Store screenshot D.png", "id": "480971648434463", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001662_480971655101129_6064421927720784354_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=S4b4t5_uKbwQ7kNvwGXowa1&_nc_oc=AdrlLjGfivDQtIxV0iZWd_nW9vnPgJxa4lIhssdfoDRVCoSgAfzuxWd-czFZhM5qgG4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTKJDfT1vxKp_nb07PVlQ4en5qqxXSD6YDBNqQOIbF9lw&oe=6AF89E08"}, {"file_name": "Store screenshot C.png", "id": "1683707145528823", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75508956_1683707148862156_8286553196679635241_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=N-0FWkpvBqgQ7kNvwEt10Fl&_nc_oc=Adp8IiZUjdsQam1BJR7B8gILldkylDxaOSM4vZ-m9xKMlxtE0uViCY7FAzIbQOHkzpU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSTghjFxmagiSGI0IptHAXD9Dj-OGCeqRrRnGerpsFRIA&oe=6AF89394"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cues Landscape v2.png", "id": "1206096493787337", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75272208_1206096497120670_6286030136535771041_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FFqiRXA-_XYQ7kNvwGjjbgF&_nc_oc=AdrHU7dbgd2HOfgpbVSBfHb_cVFmChSamxCFcPsWYLq3qbAxMiI-Q5Ow8AlORvh04vU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQSN0hCSR4mPdVdKzaGZwPzmgDdCf3uYle73Zy9RKa8wQ&oe=6AF8843B"}, "display_name": "Cues", "keywords": ["brick", "breaker", "mixed", "hand", "magic"], "long_description": "Introduce your friends and family to the magic of mixed reality with **Cues**. Dive into a **hand-tracking** experience where music meets motion. \n\n**NEW:** Creator mode lets you build anything you want with cubes. From tiny models\u2026 to living-room fortresses.\n\n- \u201cIt looks amazing. One of the coolest looking MR games I\u2019ve seen\u201d \u2013 Matt BMFVR\n\n{557242276938737}\n\n\nWield bouncing light orbs to shatter \"cues\" and unravel puzzles, all while crafting a **dynamically evolving symphony** influenced by your every move. Enjoy a relaxed, soothing game that constantly evolves, offering new challenges and surprises.\n\nIdeal for brief, engaging sessions, 'Cues' converts any room into a vibrant arena of musical puzzles.\n", "short_description": "Introduce your friends and family to the magic of mixed reality with Cues. Dive into a hand-tracking experience where music meets motion. \n\nNEW: Creator mode lets you build anything you want with cubes. From tiny models\u2026 to living-room fortresses.\n\nWield bouncing light orbs to shatter \"cues\" and unravel puzzles, all while crafting a dynamically evolving symphony influenced by your every move. Enjoy a relaxed, soothing game that constantly evolves, offering new challenges and surprises."}]}, "developer_name": "No Ragrets Games", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://noragrets.wixsite.com/noragretsgames/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://noragrets.wixsite.com/noragretsgames/eula", "publisher_name": "PotamWorks SAS", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://noragrets.wixsite.com/noragretsgames/eula", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}, {"id": "1672577396871977"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_langua